F. Dual-Blind Risk Control

Implement dual-blind approval functionality.

* Maker creates or modifies payment.
* First Checker performs independent approval.
* Second Checker performs independent approval.
* Checkers must not see each other’s decisions before submitting their own.
* Maker cannot approve their own payment.
* Approval decisions must be independent.
* Payment cannot be released until all required approvals are completed.

